Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:19.66,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:21.87,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,The least you could do is draw your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.63,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't disrespect your opponents \Nby looking away during a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:31.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You look a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.07,0:00:33.68,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,D-Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:35.05,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,In what way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:43.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:45.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:46.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.07,0:00:52.95,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Take notice when a lady \Nchanges up her hairstyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:54.82,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, was that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:59.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's not like I wanted you to notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:01.53,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.53,0:01:04.21,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If you've got time to horse around \Nwith the likes of Leonard,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:05.66,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,can you also keep an eye on that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:07.35,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,The likes of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:08.33,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:12.34,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah, you mean Sophie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:15.05,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,The likes of...?! How heartless!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.05,0:01:16.03,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why's she by herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.03,0:01:17.04,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Ignored!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.57,0:01:19.90,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's how she always is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:22.06,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Even though she obeys any \Ncommands she's given.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:23.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:24.51,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.51,0:01:27.56,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,But I've never seen her take \Nany spontaneous action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:31.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,And yet, she voluntarily told you her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:34.44,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's why I'm leaving her to you, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:35.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:38.88,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You need to build up more stamina!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:42.33,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Run ten kilometers every morning \Nfor the rest of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:45.46,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,My whole life?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.21,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yo! I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.91,0:01:50.29,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:54.01,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Earnest asked me to watch over your training!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:55.71,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:58.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:01.94,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I guess it's true that she asked me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm here because I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.93,0:02:13.73,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,But... this is all I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:15.99,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why barehanded?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:18.15,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,This is all I was taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.15,0:02:20.24,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll teach \Nyou other ways to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:22.49,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.49,0:02:23.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:26.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I want to lend you a hand as your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:29.66,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's not a command,\Nso I won't force you into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.85,0:02:32.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Are you against the idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:38.26,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:41.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's settled, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:43.39,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, first off...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:47.39,Class- Default,Instructor,0,0,0,,All right, that's it for \Ntoday's practical training!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:49.06,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.46,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,We were just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's because you took your sweet time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:54.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:36.00,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)}Episode 2
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:36.00,sign_3830_26_Earnest,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)}{\pos(163.333,222.667)}Sophie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:40.67,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I can't cut through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.10,0:04:43.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Channel your fighting spirit into the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:45.92,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You have no problem channeling \Nit into your fists, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:50.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Then think of the sword as \Nan extension of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:54.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:56.76,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.05,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I managed to cut them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.05,0:05:09.92,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You sure learn fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:12.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If you can handle a sword like this,\NI think you're set.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:15.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let's call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:17.54,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Can I beat her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:18.54,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.54,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Who do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:21.67,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:23.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:25.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:27.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Getting to her level won't be so easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.21,0:05:29.02,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:32.18,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:37.05,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.56,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,This is stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:42.57,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:46.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,By the way, I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:51.71,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be a good mount position \Nif the opponent could move freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:53.33,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:58.39,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I want you to teach me \Nsomething else tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:05:59.92,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:04.60,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,How's your school life going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:06.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I made some friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:09.20,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:12.47,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,You've been active as a hero \Nsince you were three years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:16.52,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Even I have someone I consider my best friend,\Nwhile you, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:18.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:20.78,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I really am so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:25.57,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,So, who exactly is it you call your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.07,0:06:28.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There's more than one...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But recently, I guess... Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:31.82,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:36.37,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I should have known you'd \Ntake an interest in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:39.39,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,She's a strong one, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:41.33,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:45.59,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Even so, she's still incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:46.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:51.09,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,After all, the goal was for her \Ncompleted form to surpass you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:52.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:57.29,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,You didn't befriend her because you knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:07:00.23,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,About the Artificial Great Hero Project?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.97,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.87,0:07:06.62,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,If you, the Great Hero, can exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:09.16,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,it should also be possible to \Ncreate a being just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:12.45,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That was the idea proposed \Nby a certain group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:15.37,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,With ancient forbidden \Nknowledge that had been lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:17.77,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,they took a human who showed \Naptitude as a template,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:21.71,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,and tried to artificially manifest \Nthe Great Hero's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:25.20,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,What's more, they duplicated \Nthat original human
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:29.41,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,in order to perform countless \Nexperiments and adjustments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.41,0:07:30.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:31.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hold on just one minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:32.90,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Duplicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.90,0:07:34.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I thought we were talking about Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:39.09,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Her real name is Sophitia Femto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:41.49,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Femto meaning "twelve."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:46.86,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That is to say, she's the twelfth iteration \Nof the human named Sophitia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:51.95,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,As an experimental subject, she was \Ntreated for so long as simply an object.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:55.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, don't tell me that those experiments...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:58.40,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,No need for concern!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:00.95,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I've completely put an \Nend to that organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:05.71,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,If it wasn't your doing, \Nyou should have said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:10.87,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,When I took her in, I told \Nher that she was free now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:12.22,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,She responded with...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:15.09,Class - Flashback,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:19.63,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I expect that hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.59,0:08:29.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie was robbed of a normal life \Nfor the sake of creating a Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.21,0:08:33.53,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:37.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's all because I exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:37.78,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:41.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'll make sure Sophie gets \Nher normal life back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What {\i1}is{\i0} normal, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:49.51,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Oh, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.03,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,You're not scheduled for \Nyour check-up just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:54.63,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Did you want me to look you over?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:56.26,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,In that case, take off your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.39,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Take them off right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:00.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What does being normal mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:03.14,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What kinds of things do \Nkids my age normally do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:06.95,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,So you're finally interested \Nin exploring that subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.95,0:09:08.14,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:12.03,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,I'll teach you {\i1}everything{\i0} there is \Nto know about the vigor of youth—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:13.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.89,0:09:15.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So it's youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:18.03,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,What is it, Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:20.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Youth! What does youth mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:22.06,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What does it involve?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:24.29,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,I'm not sure where this came from...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:26.16,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,But when you think of youth,\Nit'd have to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:27.25,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Love, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:28.18,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:29.04,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So it's love!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:29.97,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:30.99,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:31.92,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:33.24,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What is love?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.93,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What do you do when you're in love?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:37.18,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What? Love?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:38.94,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:40.38,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Go on! Out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:43.56,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Things like... going on dates together—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:44.46,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.46,0:09:45.89,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So it's dates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:49.06,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why'd you suddenly come up to my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:50.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:51.53,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:52.85,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What exactly do you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:53.78,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,A date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:55.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,H-H-Hold on a moment, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:56.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:58.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:09:59.16,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:00.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.09,0:10:05.33,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Couples spend time alone talking, \Nwalk around town, go shopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:09.67,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,B-But we're not at that level yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.67,0:10:12.84,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I think it's still a little \Ntoo early for a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:13.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:14.79,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm off on a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:17.46,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:19.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,With who exactly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:20.92,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Step step step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:22.20,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Where's Sophie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:24.16,Class- Default,Priestess,0,0,0,,Sophie's still inside—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:24.80,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:25.83,Class- Default,Priestess,0,0,0,,Huh?! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:26.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:27.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:28.94,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:29.69,Class- Default,Girl Student 1,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:31.19,Class- Default,Girl Student 2,0,0,0,,Blade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:33.21,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.37,0:10:35.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let's go on a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:38.15,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:39.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.31,0:10:41.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But it's very important!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:45.95,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:50.96,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes, officer, this man right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:58.56,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Blade barged into the girls' shower...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:00.49,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,A lot of girls have filed complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.49,0:11:02.85,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What in the world's gotten into that idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:04.22,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'll have to sternly steer \Nhim down the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:06.06,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Red bean bun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:06.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:08.20,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Here, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.63,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Please take one too, Empress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:10.52,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:11.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:14.12,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What is this? It's so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:15.89,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} a red bean bun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:17.92,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Have you never had one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:19.40,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,O-O-Of course I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.99,0:11:22.49,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.47,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So even the Empress makes faces like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.81,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,H-Hey, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:30.58,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Can you stop it with the whole Empress thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:31.96,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Lady Earnest, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.25,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Not that, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:34.63,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Just call me Earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.00,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no! We couldn't possibly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:41.55,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Right now, we're comrades \Nunited by our mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:45.08,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,to watch Blade so he doesn't \Ntry any funny business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:46.35,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You could...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:49.54,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,p-practically say that we're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:50.29,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:51.64,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:54.06,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Ah, it's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:56.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:58.99,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is that not normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:01.53,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:02.89,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:04.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Leave everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:07.03,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I did loads of studying for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.03,0:12:10.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, let's review our agenda for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Assemble at 1000 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.08,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Salute and briefing at 1001 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:14.22,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Begin mobilizing at 1003 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:15.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Patrol town until 1030 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:17.48,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Afterwards, R&R at a parlor until 1100 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:18.61,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Lunch time starting at 1200 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:20.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Further agenda items to follow at lunch time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:22.07,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Isn't that a little too precise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:23.84,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,This sounds less like a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:25.80,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,And more like a spec ops mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:27.97,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's already 1004 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.97,0:12:29.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:31.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The agenda! The agenda!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:35.55,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We just need to begin mobilizing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:37.06,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:41.92,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,W-Walking arm in arm? How indecent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:43.47,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,That's totally normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:44.58,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Calm down, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:45.79,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:48.05,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,It's a nickname, since we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:49.75,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Should I call you something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:53.18,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm fine with Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:53.87,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:57.05,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I lost sight of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:12:59.20,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Heave-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:11.04,Class- Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:11.73,Class- Default,Man,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.73,0:13:12.72,Class- Default,Woman,0,0,0,,They're eating it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.72,0:13:14.27,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I want to try feeding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.72,0:13:16.35,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay! Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:20.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let's dump it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:21.48,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.65,0:13:26.24,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Too much! There's too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:29.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What's with the date-like activities?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:31.48,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,They {\i1}are{\i0} on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:35.07,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,There they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:37.50,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Heave-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:39.49,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I just need to punch this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:41.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, on the count of two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:42.25,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:44.23,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I-I'll have you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.23,0:13:46.24,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly capable of this much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.52,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Th-That aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.52,0:13:49.14,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,W-We need to stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.14,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.47,0:13:54.10,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Aw, man, they've done it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:55.60,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,We're so sorry! We're so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:57.54,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You can send the bill to Rosewood Academy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:58.35,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Heave-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:03.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Our next mission is to finish this\NLovely Infinite Tropical Drink together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.69,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I just need to drink this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.69,0:14:06.54,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:08.14,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's only 1029 hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:09.16,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,We've still got one minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:11.21,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.21,0:14:13.05,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well... that's fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:17.28,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's hard to sip this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:18.86,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Come a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:19.92,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:23.42,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:25.90,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:27.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But it feels...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:28.17,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Feels...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:32.12,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I can't complete this mission by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:33.68,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:35.85,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I-I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:36.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:39.50,Class - Italics,Blade,0,0,0,,Be still, my beating heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.57,0:14:43.80,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Come a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.19,Class - Italics,Blade,0,0,0,,My heart... My heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:47.65,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,They haven't noticed us at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:49.28,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I think I've gotten sick of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:52.29,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How obscene! Dirty! Impure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:53.11,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Filthy animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.11,0:14:54.76,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Their cheeks are touching!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:55.62,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Here, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:56.70,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:00.12,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Cheeks cheekily chafing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:02.39,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So cool and sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.39,0:15:04.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What is this yummy treat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.86,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's called a parfait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:07.61,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Yum yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:09.52,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,So are you done now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:10.42,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:12.54,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,They've already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:17.15,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Heave-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:19.28,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:23.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, it felt like we were being followed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:25.09,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:27.03,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:29.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Anyway, next on the agenda...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.73,0:15:32.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Look at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:35.53,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:37.37,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We can take a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:01.68,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is this our final target?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:04.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I heard this is a legendary fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:06.83,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't really understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.83,0:16:08.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Me, neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.90,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I had fun today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:14.66,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:19.91,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Can I ask one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:21.91,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:25.38,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Why are you going to all this trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:27.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why, you ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:29.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:32.42,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,you're my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.69,0:16:38.18,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You and I are friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:39.57,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.57,0:16:40.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You bet we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:46.94,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I heard friends don't keep \Nsecrets from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.37,0:16:50.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.73,0:16:54.37,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,There's something I haven't told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:54.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:59.36,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,If you and I are friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:03.60,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,If you're willing to be my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:06.46,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,there's something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:10.71,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm not an ordinary human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:16.70,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,An incomplete test subject, \Ncreated to be an artificial hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:22.22,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I was granted what are known as \NArtificial Great Hero Powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.47,0:17:25.85,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Artificial... Great Hero Powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.31,0:17:26.85,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:37.36,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Great Hero Powers can \Nalter the laws of physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:38.84,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.49,0:17:45.27,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I have incomplete control of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:50.13,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Gravity manipulation...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:54.79,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I magnified my body weight by 1,000 \Ntimes... or that was my intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:56.38,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,This is actually around 10,000 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:57.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:04.85,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I can even stop time itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:14.05,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,As I am now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:18.15,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I can manifest Artificial Great \NHero Powers for just ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:21.37,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Sophitia Femto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:27.04,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The twelfth clone of a woman named Sophitia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.29,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That is what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:32.60,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The final model of the \NArtificial Great Hero Project,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:35.51,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,and its sole success, with caveats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:41.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,In that case, I won't \Nkeep any secrets, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.49,0:18:42.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:44.51,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:46.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:48.14,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,They call me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:53.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,They call me... the Great Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.71,0:19:01.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, they {\i1}used{\i0} to call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:04.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Those powers are gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:05.82,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:08.75,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Could it be that you realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:09.89,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.89,0:19:13.54,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,But something about you felt familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:16.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:19.80,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's not something that an apology \Nand forgiveness can fix...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.62,0:19:22.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Feel free to resent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:25.05,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:30.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Because the reason you were born \Nwith such accursed powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:31.77,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Accursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:33.33,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:35.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,This power is a curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:37.78,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I never...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:41.03,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The Great Hero wasn't \Nsomething I asked to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:47.04,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But because they said I could save everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.24,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,that's why there was no choice but to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:52.48,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,With powers that manifested \Nat the age of three...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:55.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Fighting monsters,\Nfighting them again and again...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.53,0:19:59.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Lingering between life and \Ndeath countless times...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.71,0:20:01.13,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,And growing strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:05.59,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Even so, not every single \Nperson can be rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.59,0:20:07.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There are those who couldn't be saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:10.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,People get so angry when \Nyou can't save someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:12.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why didn't you save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.41,0:20:14.90,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Aren't you the Great Hero?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:20.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's... It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.19,0:20:26.57,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The Great Hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:29.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What does it mean to be the Great Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:38.94,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:44.80,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Even if you didn't choose to be,\Nyou were the Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:49.25,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,After being rescued by the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.25,0:20:52.56,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I left on a journey to find out who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:55.06,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,People saved by the Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.22,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Entire towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:20:58.64,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I came across so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.93,0:21:04.84,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You should be proud of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:06.06,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:07.88,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.39,0:21:09.77,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's fine if you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:11.20,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:17.73,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I take pride in the fact that I was \Ncreated to be an Artificial Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.73,0:21:18.42,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.85,0:21:22.30,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I want to become like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:27.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's... That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:30.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:37.94,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,won't let my past as the \NGreat Hero bother me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:39.10,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:43.36,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,If that's what you decide, then that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:48.61,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Your identity as the Great Hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.61,0:21:50.49,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,is the secret we share.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:55.75,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:58.37,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Just between the two of us.
